        "id": "68e9925c0a4ed70c06879558",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Our family of 5 plus my parents stayed here and it was perfect. Beach access is super close and it's very quiet. The beach wasn't as crowded as other places we stayed. We had a few small issues and property management was on them ASAP. We would definitely consider staying here again.",
        "themes": [
