        "id": "6925b472c6e39b39de60ea94",
        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "It was a perfect place for a large adulting family to call home for a family wedding at Monet-Monet. Great shops around. Well appointed kitchen except would have expected basic salt and pepper to be in the cabinet. The availability of the bikes and beach chairs was a great surprise. The front porch of the main house was our favorite gathering spot... The carriage house apartment was fantastic too.",
